# inactive example — copy to .github/CODEOWNERS, replace @org/tech-lead, and require code-owner review in branch protection to activate.
# High-risk paths (definition: AGENTS.md) get a second approver. A change spanning several apps/* cannot be
# expressed as a path; the reviewer applies that tier by hand.

/packages/          @org/tech-lead
**/openapi.*        @org/tech-lead
**/*.proto          @org/tech-lead
**/migrations/      @org/tech-lead
**/auth/            @org/tech-lead
**/permissions/     @org/tech-lead
**/security/        @org/tech-lead
